            "review_title": "Review at Cha Ca La Vong Restaurant",
            "review_text": "nguyen dien v\n3 contributions\n0\nTrash in the food, no apology, and terrible service\nSep 2026 • Family\nI saw a weird looking scallion head in my food. Showed the waiters and asked them what was it. Before they took it back, we thought again and opened it up a bit. They took it to the kitchen. \nAnd after that, throught out the whole meal, no one came to provide us any answer nor apologized, \nWhen we asked for the bill after finished eating. Another waiter who didn’t serve us came with the check, still no explanation nor apology were said. So we asked about it. The waiter nonchalantly answered, saying it was a bill. That’s all! \nWe were shocked with how they dealt with it. We asked them to report it to the manager or anyone could be responsible for it. They said the manager took a day off today. And still no apology!\nOnly after we brought the apology matter up and made a fuss about it, they simply said sorry half-heartedly! Asked a human being, and especially a customer, I felt really offended and taken a back at how can someone can be lack of simple manner.\nIn the end no manager or supervisor showed up to take responsibility! One of the waitress and the cashier had really bad attitude! \nRuined my night! Never come back!\n\nWe figured it could have been an old bill from previous customer that was left in their left-over veggies. The restaurant might have reused the veggies and mistakenly served it together with our veggies. No explanation was provided so…\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 16, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
