            "review_text": "conscienciouseater\nAsia, Peru2983 contributions\n0\nGood food but poor service\nAug 2026 • Family\nWe love chả cá. In our opinion, the dish served here is the best in Saigon (better than at competitor Đế Vương), although not as good as in Hanoi, where Thăng Long is far superior. Portions are tiny, so order more than one portion per person. Severely understaffed, so recently service is polite but pretty bad: they keep forgetting orders.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 29, 2026",
