            "review_text": "Vy H.\nWashington DC, District of Columbia7203 contributions\n0\nLunch in Ho Chi Minh, Vietnam\nMar 2024 • Couples\nLove the chả cá here!!! Just note, this place only serves this specific dish here. The cá (fish) is well flavored and even better once the dill/onions cook more with it—the smell is amazing. The purple dipping sauce has quite a distinct smell, so it could take some getting used to it before you can fully enjoy it—but once you do, it’s delicious with the fish and noodles!\nRead more\nWritten March 18, 2024",
