            "review_text": "Explorer21226980620\n1 contribution\n0\nThe service staff was very inattentive\nOct 2023 • Family\nMy table ordered first but another table was served first. I reminded, the waiter apologized and said it was down there (?). Then brought a new batch, again to another table (???), but to the table next to the table behind my own. When I came down to give comments, there was no manager, only a cashier or receptionist or something. Yes, apologizing and that's it. A lunch that should have been fun for my family turned out to be extremely unpleasant because of the waiter's arrogant attitude. Then I don't know who to turn to for advice\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten October 27, 2023",
