            "review_text": "Phuong Vo\n2 contributions\n1\nDisappointed\nMar 2020 • Couples\nTotally disappointed with the food and service. The Cha Ca is not even close to one in Hanoi if you look for such thing. And it’s ridiculously pricey, 200,000 for a tiny portion that won’t fill an adult. The fish is dry and taste plain. They don’t accept cards for such a big restaurant and even charge the parking, which is not much but annoying because the security is not friendly, the parking charge should have been included in the bill for such a restaurant. By the way, they use quite a lot of MSG. I won’t come back here.l or recommend anyone.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 8, 2020",
